{"id":1009,"root":"نكف","bw":"nkf","tr":"n-k-f","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكِفَ مِنَالشَّىْءِ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>, aor. <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكَفَ</span> </span>; inf. n. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكَفٌ</span>; and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكَفَ</span>, aor. <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكُفَ</span> </span>; and ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استنكف</span>; <em>He abstained from, or refused to do, the thing, from disdain and pride.</em> (Msb.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَنَكَّفَ بِمَوضِعِ كَذَا</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> [<em>He waited,</em> &amp;c.,] <em>i. q.</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَلَيَّثَ</span>. (TA in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صقر</span>, from the “ Nawádir. ”) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِسْتَنْكَفَ مِنْهُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> (KL, * MA) <em>He disdained,</em> or <em>scorned, it; was ashamed of it.</em> (KL, MA.) See 1. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكَفَةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غُنْدُبَةٌ</span>, and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لُغْدٌ</span>. </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":1098,"entries":4,"shownEntries":4,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"nkf"}